{
  "configMeta": {
    "description": "Experimental: WFS vector layer examples from multiple CDTK (VPN required) services with associated WMS layers. <ul><li>Airborne: Test of WFS feature queries for airborne radioactivity using its associated WMS layer.</li><li>Assessment Inventory: Test querying completed and terminated projects from one WFS service, with project names used as feature titles.</li><li>Completed Inventory Custom Style: Test applying a unique-value point style by project category to WFS features.</li><li>Charging Corridor: Test linking WFS and WMS layers whose published identifiers differ.</li><li>Charging Corridor Forced Style: Test overriding the corridor line style with categories based on the final score field.</li><li>Critical Minerals: Test of WFS feature queries for the mines layer with its associated WMS.</li><li>Abandoned Orphaned Mines: Test of WFS feature queries for the abandoned and orphaned mines layer with its associated WMS.</li><li>Earthquakes 2000-2010: Test using magnitude as the feature title for earthquake records.</li><li>GSC Photo Collection: Test of WFS feature queries for the seabed photo collection with its associated WMS.</li><li>Pacific Seismic Reflection: Test of WFS feature queries for the Pacific seismic reflection layer with its associated WMS.</li><li>Surficial Geology: Test of WFS feature queries for the DMF layer with its associated WMS.</li><li>Lidar Point Cloud Elevation: Test of WFS feature queries for lidar project data with its associated WMS.</li><li>Wind Turbine: Test of WFS feature queries for wind turbine data with its associated WMS.</li><li>Regions: Test of WFS feature queries for physical regions with its associated WMS.</li><li>Major Projects: Test loading point and line WFS layers together under one GeoView layer.</li></ul>"
  },
